OL,3,AMore women likely to come forward, says
OL,4,Adetective who led Russell Brand
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: Details of rape and sexual
OL,8,Fassault
OL,10,FMore victims of disgraced comedian
OL,11,FRussell Brand are likely to come
OL,12,Fforward now that he has been found
OL,13,Fguilty of rape and sexual assault, the
OL,14,Fdetective who led the police
OL,15,Finvestigation has said.
OL,17,FDet Supt Andy Furphy, from the
OL,18,FMetropolitan Police, said he hoped
OL,19,Fother women would gain "courage" and
OL,20,F"confidence" from the guilty verdicts.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
