OL,3,AMore women likely to come forward, says
OL,4,Adetective who led Russell Brand
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand has been found guilty of one
OL,8,Fcount of rape and three counts of
OL,9,Fsexual assault by a jury of eight men
OL,10,Fand four women at Southwark Crown
OL,11,FCourt, following a three-week trial. He
OL,12,Fwas found not guilty of two counts of
OL,13,Frape and one count of attempted
OL,14,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
