OL,3,ADemocrats outline aims for Congress
OL,4,Aafter midterm wins, as Trump weighs in
OL,5,Aon knife-edge Alaska vote
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump weighs in on
OL,8,FAlaska's tightly-fought Senate race, as
OL,9,FRepublican Dan Sullivan trails Democrat
OL,10,FMary Peltola by a razor-thin margin
OL,12,FTrump says that votes for the "Fake Dan
OL,13,FSullivan" - an independent candidate
OL,14,Fwho has the same name as the Republican
OL,15,Fhopeful - should be given to the
OL,16,FRepublican candidate
OL,18,FIt comes as a top Democrat says
OL,19,FCongress will rein in "an
OL,20,Fout-of-control executive branch" after
OL,21,Fhis party won control of both houses in
OL,22,Fthe midterm elections
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
